  "editorial": {
    "name": "Avvvatars",
    "descriptionZh": "一个 React 头像库，把用户名或邮箱喂进去，返回带字符和配色的占位头像；同一套形状也打包成了 Figma 文件。",
    "takeawayZh": "yarn add avvvatars-react，一行代码出占位头像",
    "noteZh": "首屏是粉紫渐变底，正中大标题 Free UI Avatars for Your Next Project，下面并排 Get on Github 和 Figma File 两个按钮，再下一行标着 v0.4.2，六项卖点排成三列两行——Easy to Use / 40 Unique Colors / Lightweight / Accesible / 60 Unique Shapes / Customizable。再往下是一张白卡，把 1 Install package、2 Import it to Your React Component、3 Enjoy! 三步并排摆开，第三步直接给出 <Avvvatars value=\"tim@apple.com\" />。右下方挂着一枚 Product Hunt 的 #1 Product of the Day 徽章。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
